      <h1 class="blog-title">Could You Get a Free Boiler in Liverpool? The ECO4 Scheme Explained</h1>
      <p style="font-size:1.05rem;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">Some Liverpool homes on certain benefits may get a free boiler or heating upgrade through the ECO4 scheme. Here is who may qualify, what it can cover and where to apply. We do not offer ECO4 or any grants. This guide is for information only.</p>
      <div class="blog-meta">
        <span><strong>By</strong> Liverpool Emergency Plumber</span>
        <span><strong>Gas Safe Registered Plumber</strong></span>
        <span>Published April 2026</span>
        <span>Updated 26 November 2026</span>
        <span>6 min read</span>
      </div>
    </div>
